      "raw": "[quote=\"AlexxKay\"]\n\nIn a recent rules discussion an acquaintance made the claim that any given card can only redirect a specific packet of damage once. Last I saw, (compiled in Spiff&#39;s FAQ), that was not the case: <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-answers-from-chris-at-pax-4082\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/rules-answers-from-chris-at-pax-4082</a> . Did this change at some point when I wasn&#39;t paying attention (it was over a year ago)?\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI used to think that way and had somehow convinced myself that the one redirect per card per dealing of damage was actually a rule, or at least a really useful heuristic, but it has since been ruled differently, as noted in Spiff&#39;s FAQ.\n",
